WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.540
Have you ever sat down to pray

2
00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:06.780
and had no idea what to say?

3
00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.120
Romans eight speaks directly to that weakness.

4
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:12.400
Paul says we do not know

5
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.120
what to pray for as we ought.

6
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.040
Then he tells us that

7
00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:18.760
the Spirit himself intercedes for us.

8
00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:21.080
God knows the mind of the Spirit,

9
00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:23.840
whose intercession is according to God's will.

10
00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:25.940
For those who belong to Christ,

11
00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.740
help is already present

12
00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.900
in the middle of confusion and grief.

13
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.500
You can come to God

14
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.760
with the words you have,

15
00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.560
even when they feel unfinished.

16
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.740
When prayer is difficult today,

17
00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.580
remember the Spirit's help.

18
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.480
Bring your weakness to God,

19
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:41.660
and keep coming.
